<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VisDocSketcher</span>: Towards Scalable Visual Documentation
<br class="ltx_break">with Agentic Systems</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Software and its engineering Documentation</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Human-centered computing Visualization systems and tools</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Human-centered computing Empirical studies in visualization</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Multi-agent planning</span></span></span>
